WEBVTT

00:01.250 --> 00:03.590
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:30.720 --> 01:32.010
THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.

01:32.090 --> 01:33.430
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

01:42.270 --> 01:43.400
Pardon me.

01:43.480 --> 01:44.480
Lord Jinshi.

01:45.230 --> 01:47.530
Has Lady Gyokuyou gone into labor?

01:47.610 --> 01:49.690
Yes, from this morning.

01:49.780 --> 01:52.400
It’s a little earlier than scheduled,

01:52.490 --> 01:54.030
but preparations have been made.

01:54.910 --> 01:55.950
Please, go ahead.

02:07.090 --> 02:08.000
How is she?

02:08.090 --> 02:10.590
She’s calm now.

02:11.170 --> 02:15.010
The contractions have subsided,
and she shows no signs of fatigue.

02:15.800 --> 02:16.890
I see.

02:16.970 --> 02:20.770
We still don't know exactly
when she’ll give birth.

02:21.270 --> 02:22.940
And the child?

02:23.020 --> 02:26.310
It was a breech birth, but do not worry.

02:26.400 --> 02:29.940
Maomao’s treatment has been working.

02:31.780 --> 02:32.990
Maomao…

02:34.740 --> 02:37.780
It’s been ten days,
and we still haven’t found her.

02:38.580 --> 02:39.830
Is she all right?

02:46.960 --> 02:50.840
Mr. Luomen, if there’s anything I can do…

02:50.920 --> 02:52.840
Master! You're in the way!

02:52.920 --> 02:55.260
Don’t block the entrance!

02:56.390 --> 02:58.430
Watch the cat if you have to!

02:58.510 --> 02:59.430
Ye… Yes!

03:04.890 --> 03:08.730
Seeing someone more flustered than me
somehow makes me calm down…

03:13.570 --> 03:15.950
Then I’ll return for now.

03:16.030 --> 03:17.740
Let me know if anything comes up.

03:18.990 --> 03:19.870
Lord Jinshi!

03:20.490 --> 03:21.580
What is it?

03:22.870 --> 03:25.000
It’s about the missing eunuch…

03:29.250 --> 03:31.550
So, what did you find out?

03:31.630 --> 03:33.920
His name is Tian.

03:34.010 --> 03:36.840
He is said to be a former slave
from a foreign tribe.

03:36.930 --> 03:40.720
But it seems he had no ties to the group
he supposedly arrived with.

03:40.800 --> 03:44.020
Most likely, he slipped in
from somewhere else.

03:45.810 --> 03:47.900
To infiltrate the Rear Palace?

03:49.270 --> 03:52.730
Yes. He avoided getting too close
to others to avoid slipping up.

03:53.230 --> 03:55.990
Because of that, there’s so little
information left about him.

03:58.240 --> 03:59.070
Anything else?

03:59.160 --> 04:02.790
There’s a witness who saw him
praying at the temple.

04:02.870 --> 04:05.580
If he's devout, that wouldn’t be unusual.

04:06.620 --> 04:07.790
Yes, but…

04:12.920 --> 04:16.260
-The northern cemetery…
-Yes.

04:17.050 --> 04:19.010
It’s the gravesite for those who served

04:19.090 --> 04:21.890
the former emperor
and passed away in the Rear Palace.

04:25.600 --> 04:30.520
Someone saw Tian
praying at one of the graves.

04:31.480 --> 04:32.940
TAIHOU

04:35.190 --> 04:36.860
In the era of the former emperor,

04:36.940 --> 04:40.160
even after death,
the young girls who perished early

04:40.240 --> 04:43.030
weren’t allowed to leave the Rear Palace.

04:48.210 --> 04:50.620
Without their names ever being recorded,

04:51.920 --> 04:53.960
they vanished quietly in this garden.

05:01.970 --> 05:03.470
A palace woman from the clinic?

05:05.010 --> 05:07.020
Excuse me.

05:12.440 --> 05:13.520
This scent…

05:22.200 --> 05:23.370
Where did Maomao go?

05:29.410 --> 05:33.040
Calm down.
Right now, I am now the eunuch Jinshi.

05:33.130 --> 05:34.420
Act normal.

05:38.050 --> 05:39.880
I want to ask about

05:39.970 --> 05:43.050
the freckled palace woman
from the Jade Palace.

05:43.140 --> 05:44.600
Do you know anything?

05:54.810 --> 05:55.980
You know something, right?

05:57.230 --> 06:00.030
I remember now…

06:00.860 --> 06:02.360
An old memory…

06:06.530 --> 06:09.450
He called my name in a gentle voice.

06:10.580 --> 06:14.330
He gave me foreign candy.

06:27.550 --> 06:29.350
What are you talking about?

06:29.850 --> 06:34.270
You don't know what he was like
in his youth?

06:35.150 --> 06:38.020
I heard he became a shadow
of his former self over the years.

06:39.150 --> 06:42.740
After I grew up, he stopped visiting.

06:42.820 --> 06:45.490
I only heard stories.

06:46.070 --> 06:47.660
Who are you talking about?

06:47.740 --> 06:49.990
You look just like him.

06:50.080 --> 06:51.250
What are you saying?

06:51.870 --> 06:54.000
He also…

06:54.080 --> 06:57.630
had a voice as sweet as honey

06:57.710 --> 07:01.050
and a face like a heavenly maiden…

07:02.210 --> 07:04.800
Why would someone like you

07:04.880 --> 07:07.850
play the role of a eunuch?

07:12.020 --> 07:13.180
Get her!

07:13.810 --> 07:14.980
Let go of me!

07:15.060 --> 07:16.190
Don’t struggle!

07:17.730 --> 07:19.230
Lord Jinshi, what should we do?

07:22.320 --> 07:23.320
Lord Jinshi!

07:31.660 --> 07:33.410
What?! Poison?!

07:35.080 --> 07:36.750
-Bring water!
-Yes, Sir!

07:38.330 --> 07:40.090
Lord Jinshi, your orders!

07:42.800 --> 07:44.130
Lord Jinshi!

07:48.340 --> 07:52.810
Take her to the medical office.
Make sure she doesn’t try anything else!

07:52.890 --> 07:53.850
Yes, Sir!

07:57.100 --> 07:58.600
Please, stay strong!

07:58.690 --> 08:01.190
Don’t be shaken by
a mere palace woman's joke.

08:02.610 --> 08:03.860
Joke…

08:05.150 --> 08:07.780
Would someone risk their life for a joke?

08:10.870 --> 08:14.450
She looked pale after she saw me smile.

08:15.040 --> 08:16.710
He also had…

08:18.290 --> 08:19.630
Gaoshun…

08:19.710 --> 08:22.170
do I resemble him?

08:22.750 --> 08:25.960
Enough to frighten her.
Enough to make her drink poison.

08:28.130 --> 08:30.050
That man in my memories

08:30.890 --> 08:32.800
already seemed like an old man.

08:34.930 --> 08:38.520
He didn't resemble my mother
or my brother.

08:39.020 --> 08:39.980
That’s why…

08:40.980 --> 08:42.610
That’s why I believed…

08:44.110 --> 08:46.280
Who could he have resembled?

08:46.360 --> 08:48.570
Given the Emperor's tastes,

08:48.650 --> 08:51.070
it can’t be the Empress. She’s too old.

08:53.160 --> 08:55.990
That’s why they say it, right?
He’s an illegitimate child.

09:04.420 --> 09:07.550
I believed the rumor
that I wasn’t related by blood

09:08.050 --> 09:10.430
and tried to escape
from my position as Crown Prince.

09:11.590 --> 09:14.100
Begging my brother who is the Emperor,

09:14.600 --> 09:18.350
why am I in a women's quarters
taking the name of a eunuch?

09:20.100 --> 09:21.980
There’s no word for it but disgrace.

09:36.870 --> 09:39.410
TAIHOU

09:51.630 --> 09:54.390
I will simply do what I am…

09:55.220 --> 09:56.680
Able to.

09:58.430 --> 10:01.520
That’s right. I can laugh at myself later.

10:02.020 --> 10:03.650
Now, I must do what needs to be done.

10:05.360 --> 10:08.400
That palace woman
was praying at this grave?

10:08.900 --> 10:09.780
Yes.

10:12.030 --> 10:14.410
It’s out of season
for Chinese lantern plants.

10:16.740 --> 10:18.410
Taihou.

10:18.490 --> 10:20.410
The name of a palace woman
who died last year.

10:21.830 --> 10:22.660
Yeah.

10:23.330 --> 10:26.290
She often gathered people
to tell ghost stories.

10:27.840 --> 10:30.630
She was once an attendant
to a certain noble family.

10:38.060 --> 10:39.180
Her relatives…

10:43.640 --> 10:46.190
Only one blood relative remains.

10:46.860 --> 10:48.360
During the former emperor's reign,

10:48.440 --> 10:51.190
A daughter was born from an illicit affair
with the court physician.

10:53.780 --> 10:56.030
If that child is still alive…

11:02.370 --> 11:04.670
-Where to?
-The Garnet Pavilion.

11:14.010 --> 11:15.930
The consort whom Taihou was serving

11:16.010 --> 11:19.390
was given to Shishou
and gave birth to a daughter.

11:19.890 --> 11:21.890
That daughter is Consort Loulan.

11:22.680 --> 11:26.770
However, the daughter born to
Taihou and the court physician,

11:27.980 --> 11:30.440
disappeared with the court physician

11:30.940 --> 11:32.980
after being expelled from the rear palace.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.500
If it's Consort Loulan,

11:44.580 --> 11:48.000
she might know the whereabouts of
the court physician and the daughter.

11:49.750 --> 11:51.630
It’s only intuition, though.

11:51.710 --> 11:54.670
There may be no real connection.

11:55.170 --> 11:56.010
Still…

11:58.470 --> 11:59.300
Please.

12:00.720 --> 12:02.140
I’ll do everything

12:03.060 --> 12:04.270
I can.

12:10.560 --> 12:12.730
I apologize for the sudden visit.

12:16.950 --> 12:19.240
She says it’s no trouble.

12:19.990 --> 12:21.370
Thank you very much.

12:22.830 --> 12:24.870
As always a peculiar sight.

12:25.370 --> 12:27.210
Flashy outfits,

12:27.290 --> 12:29.500
with matching heavily winged eye makeup.

12:31.000 --> 12:32.500
Just like foxes.

12:33.750 --> 12:36.630
Today, I have something
I would like to ask…

12:40.340 --> 12:41.470
Lord Jinshi…?

12:43.470 --> 12:44.310
What are you doing?

12:47.810 --> 12:50.270
There were seven attendants,
if I recall correctly.

12:50.900 --> 12:52.560
Where is the other one?

12:54.110 --> 12:59.280
I keep track of the attendant's names
and faces who serve at the palace.

12:59.950 --> 13:03.870
Although their clothes and makeup
change daily,

13:04.370 --> 13:07.330
I memorized their obvious parts.

13:07.410 --> 13:08.790
For example,

13:08.870 --> 13:12.330
the shape of your lips or eyes.

13:12.960 --> 13:14.500
Also…

13:16.340 --> 13:17.760
the placement of your mole.

13:19.470 --> 13:22.800
Soulin? No, maybe Renpu?

13:23.510 --> 13:25.010
What's your name?

13:27.890 --> 13:30.270
It was a setup from the beginning.

13:30.770 --> 13:32.900
She chose only aides

13:32.980 --> 13:35.480
who resembled you,
bringing a large entourage.

13:36.110 --> 13:39.570
The odd makeup and flashy dress

13:40.070 --> 13:42.990
it was all for just for this.

13:43.700 --> 13:45.490
-Lord Jinshi…
-Tell me!

13:45.580 --> 13:48.080
Where did the real one go?

13:50.290 --> 13:52.460
Where did she go?

13:56.380 --> 13:58.260
Where is Consort Loulan?!

13:59.210 --> 14:01.010
I’m truly sorry…

14:01.090 --> 14:04.340
Renpu doesn’t know anything.

14:05.550 --> 14:06.560
Please…

14:07.470 --> 14:08.970
forgive us…

14:18.070 --> 14:20.360
Damn it. Calm down.

14:23.700 --> 14:26.490
So, you didn't ask where she went?

14:27.160 --> 14:30.000
Yes. I was told
she wouldn’t be coming back.

14:30.660 --> 14:34.830
So the high-ranking consort left
the Rear Palace of her own will.

14:50.390 --> 14:52.730
No point pushing them any further.

14:56.730 --> 14:58.570
We’re searching as much as possible,

14:58.650 --> 15:01.230
but there is no one similar
to Consort Loulan.

15:02.070 --> 15:04.320
No need to address her as consort.

15:05.990 --> 15:08.780
If she fled the Rear Palace,
it’s a serious crime.

15:08.870 --> 15:10.990
Even more so for a high-ranking consort.

15:12.330 --> 15:14.580
She must have planned it, fully aware.

15:15.080 --> 15:16.120
Yes.

15:17.290 --> 15:20.380
Placing a Senior official’s daughter
in the rear palace.

15:20.960 --> 15:23.010
That, for the emperor,
was a move of great benefit.

15:24.010 --> 15:25.510
As a hostage,

15:25.590 --> 15:28.550
he could trap her in the birdcage
that is the rear palace.

15:30.100 --> 15:33.730
It looked like Shishou
cared about his daughter.

15:34.230 --> 15:37.310
But in truth, how was it really?

15:40.570 --> 15:43.110
What about Maomao…?

15:44.360 --> 15:47.990
She joked about being like
a runaway courtesan…

15:49.620 --> 15:51.700
Did she willingly go along with her?

15:52.290 --> 15:55.250
If so, she wouldn't have left a note.

15:56.370 --> 15:59.540
Where did she go and for what reason?

16:05.380 --> 16:06.470
What?

16:07.050 --> 16:10.800
Maomao’s whereabouts are unknown?

16:16.310 --> 16:19.400
Wait, Maomao!

16:20.480 --> 16:24.780
Daddy's coming to save you!

16:27.240 --> 16:29.700
Lord Lakan!

16:31.490 --> 16:32.870
How did it get out?

16:33.370 --> 16:35.700
It seems the news somehow
leaked to the outside.

16:36.290 --> 16:37.620
Geez…

16:38.120 --> 16:41.580
Also, we haven't
been able to locate Shishou.

16:42.590 --> 16:44.800
Was he working with Loulan?

16:44.880 --> 16:46.460
I don't know.

16:46.550 --> 16:49.760
But he’s the father
of the runaway consort.

16:50.260 --> 16:53.890
As someone who bears a grudge
against the emperor, he'll be guilty.

16:54.890 --> 16:56.430
Yes, I believe so.

16:57.890 --> 17:00.520
Also, the lady from yesterday, Shenlü,

17:01.230 --> 17:03.110
has cheated death for now.

17:04.520 --> 17:05.570
Is she conscious?

17:06.190 --> 17:07.690
Not yet.

17:08.990 --> 17:13.450
However, it seems
she was acquainted with Taihou.

17:13.950 --> 17:16.870
She likely joined the rebellion
because of that connection.

17:17.750 --> 17:19.290
Everybody in the clinic?

17:20.250 --> 17:21.080
No.

17:22.460 --> 17:26.300
The others didn’t know anything
about the rebellion.

17:29.800 --> 17:32.010
Still, they cooperated

17:32.090 --> 17:35.060
because they shared
the same grudge as Shenlü.

17:36.430 --> 17:38.310
Since the former emperor’s death,

17:38.390 --> 17:42.520
the women’s resentment
has been directed at the Rear Palace.

17:46.570 --> 17:48.740
We must find Loulan immediately.

17:49.240 --> 17:51.200
But there’s too little information.

17:51.700 --> 17:53.910
Should we chase Shishou first…?

17:54.910 --> 17:57.790
No, someone else is already after him.

18:03.920 --> 18:05.210
Who could it be?

18:05.920 --> 18:06.920
Come in.

18:08.420 --> 18:09.880
Excuse me.

18:20.850 --> 18:21.890
An abacus?

18:22.520 --> 18:23.690
What’s your business?

18:26.230 --> 18:30.440
It’s an honor to meet you.
My name is Kan Lahan.

18:31.990 --> 18:34.610
In the outer court,
the only one bearing the name "La" is

18:34.700 --> 18:37.530
Lakan and Lahan.

18:38.030 --> 18:41.120
It was a surname bestowed
long ago by the imperial family.

18:42.500 --> 18:46.080
The "La" clan…
you're the General's adopted son.

18:46.170 --> 18:47.250
What is your business?

18:48.550 --> 18:50.920
I wanted to show this to you.

18:59.140 --> 19:00.310
What is it?

19:00.810 --> 19:02.180
What do you think?

19:03.810 --> 19:05.600
A ledger from the national treasury.

19:06.100 --> 19:07.230
Yes.

19:07.310 --> 19:10.230
I was ordered by my father
to investigate it.

19:10.320 --> 19:14.360
But the origin of Feifa
is unclear, which is troubling.

19:14.860 --> 19:16.410
Why to the national treasury?

19:16.990 --> 19:20.030
When I looked into those
around the punished officials…

19:20.740 --> 19:22.080
Naturally, it led me here.

19:22.700 --> 19:25.830
I wanted you to see the actual goods,

19:25.920 --> 19:28.250
but the volume was oddly large.

19:28.920 --> 19:31.880
I excerpted as much as I can see.

19:32.960 --> 19:37.140
Crop values have clearly risen
in the past few years…

19:37.220 --> 19:39.140
Interesting, isn’t it?

19:39.220 --> 19:42.020
There weren’t any locusts or droughts.

19:42.520 --> 19:44.140
And another thing.

19:44.230 --> 19:46.600
For some reason,
the value of iron has also risen.

19:47.440 --> 19:50.110
Also, metal prices across the country.

19:52.360 --> 19:56.400
I checked if there were any
massive construction projects underway.

19:56.910 --> 20:01.200
But no such plans could be found.

20:01.990 --> 20:05.040
His thoroughness is just like
his adoptive father.

20:06.250 --> 20:07.710
I understand what you mean.

20:08.370 --> 20:12.420
Grains themselves aren't worth much,
but the quantity is vast.

20:12.500 --> 20:16.050
If the prices go up,
the difference becomes considerable.

20:16.590 --> 20:19.470
Someone is pocketing that difference.

20:20.180 --> 20:21.970
And then, metal prices are rising.

20:22.470 --> 20:25.430
Someone’s been buying up
large quantities here too.

20:26.560 --> 20:27.980
Is that what you want to say?

20:28.600 --> 20:29.770
Yes.

20:29.850 --> 20:31.230
As I see it,

20:31.310 --> 20:34.190
these two leads are headed
in the same direction.

20:34.280 --> 20:35.110
Also,

20:35.190 --> 20:39.410
whoever can pull off
something of this scale is limited.

20:41.780 --> 20:45.700
I would be able to
look into it more thoroughly.

20:47.120 --> 20:50.420
Wouldn’t you like to know

20:50.500 --> 20:52.710
where the flow is converging?

21:00.180 --> 21:02.010
So… what do you want?

21:04.680 --> 21:07.770
You’re not offering this
out of goodwill, are you?

21:07.850 --> 21:08.690
Lord Jinshi!

21:10.650 --> 21:12.650
Would you be willing

21:12.730 --> 21:16.860
to knock a little off the price?

21:16.940 --> 21:17.780
What’s that for?

21:17.860 --> 21:22.320
It's for the repairs to
the rear palace gate that my father broke.

21:23.530 --> 21:25.580
Shouldn’t he be paying for that?

21:26.160 --> 21:28.370
-Fine.
-Are you sure?

21:31.210 --> 21:33.790
In exchange, investigate thoroughly.

21:33.880 --> 21:35.840
Find out what’s happening

21:36.420 --> 21:38.380
with the money and metal.

21:42.840 --> 21:44.600
As you wish…

21:46.680 --> 21:50.060
I’ll use whatever I can use…

23:45.090 --> 23:47.800
PREVIEW

23:56.640 --> 23:59.110
The next episode is "The Festival."
